  "comments": "The work was composed in the year \"me mo lugs gi lo smin drug zla ba'i dkar phyogs\" - {K\u0101rttika \u015bukla pak\u1e63a} = 1127, 1187, 1247, 1307, 1367... - when the author (ID:4674) was 80 years old.\r\n\r\nThe work is generally practice/meditation orientated and discusses the correct understanding of Mah\u0101mudr\u0101. Also mentioned are the arising of the \"thal 'gyur pa\"  in Tibet following Pa tshab (ID:3868)'s return (before which, according to the author, only the \"rang rgyud pa\" was attested in Tibet), and the ulterior emergence of the rang stong/gzhan stong distinction ((ID:5130), fol. 18.1b4-5).\r\n\r\nThe author mentions a \"zla 'od gzhon nu\" who might be sGam po pa ex64082024-12-1910-05-06 .",
  "alternative_names": "mtha' bral dbu ma chen po'i gnas lugs gsal bar byed pa'i gsal byed sgron me\r\nratna kir tis mdzad pa'i mtha' bral dbu ma'i rnam gzhag gsal byed sgron me",
